title: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-trashbin/readme
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

A sub-plugin of [[HyperGSD|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd]] that adds a button to move completed items to the trashbin, instead of deleting them outright.
Depends on Mohammad Rahmani's Trashbin ([[$:/plugins/kookma/trashbin]]).

By default, the trashbin button will coexist with the regular <q>{{$:/core/images/delete-button}}&nbsp;{{$:/language/Buttons/Delete/Caption}}</q> button.
To hide the standard {{$:/core/images/delete-button}}&nbsp;{{$:/language/Buttons/Delete/Caption}} button, open [[$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/list-items/delete]] and untag <<tag $:/tags/hypergsd/Fragment/Row/Suffix>>, or just press this button: <$button>hide {{$:/core/images/delete-button}}&nbsp;{{$:/language/Buttons/Delete/Caption}} button<$action-listops $tiddler="$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/list-items/delete" $tags="-[[$:/tags/hypergsd/Fragment/Row/Suffix]]" /></$button>

